Spec: Repositories

Purpose:
  The data API features use: rides, trackpoints and app preferences, exposed as Riverpod providers.

Owns:
  ./ride_repository.dart
  ./trackpoint_repository.dart
  ./preferences_repository.dart
  ./data_providers.dart
  /test/data/ride_repository_test.dart
  /test/data/preferences_repository_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/03-data-layer.md
  /docs/decisions/0001-ride-outlines.md

Must:
  @RideRepository and @TrackpointRepository delegate to the DAOs and stay concrete classes.
  Favouriting stores the injected clock's time; unfavouriting clears it.
  @PreferencesRepository wraps `shared_preferences` and re-emits a stream value on every write.
  Preference keys and defaults stay stable across releases.
  Writing an outline for a ride that no longer exists is ignored without an error.
  Saving a ride stores its @RideOutline; rides without one get it filled in on request, one at a time (#96).

Example:
  `user_name`: `Retrailer`
  `onboarding_done`: `false`
  `theme_mode`: `system`
  `app_language`: `system`
  `last_activity_type`: `LONGBOARD`
  `home_stats_period`: `week`
  `battery_hint_dismissed`: `false`
  `countdown_cue_enabled`: `true`
  `profile_photos`: at most `5` recent photos
  `current_profile_photo`: none
  `pending_ride_details`: none
  `history_view`: `list`
  `history_map_mode`: `lines`
